Combines log_debt_to_income_ratio and property_magnitude feature using one-hot encoded property values as weights.
# Usefulness: Highlights stress levels against owned property types, providing a nuanced risk analysis in terms of ownership.

# Feature name
normalized_final_decision_score
# Feature description
Min-max normalization on final_decision_score to bring values into [0, 1] range.
# Usefulness: Ensures score comparability across applicants, standardizing decisions regardless of initial scoring scale.
